WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.020
I would like to, if I may...

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:29.190
...provide you with an explanation
of the Gundam Fight.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.440
It all began in the recent past,
about 60 years ago.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:37.400
People had left the filthy Earth
to live in Colonies in space.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.700
And in order to avoid all-out
war among the Colony nations...

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:44.200
...a competition is held every four
years with representatives...

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.040
...from each nation piloting
Gundam machines...

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.580
...in what's known as
"Gundam Fights."

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.210
And the pilots fight. And they
fight. And they continue fighting...

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:55.170
...until the nation represented
by the last standing Gundam...

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:59.260
...earns the right to rule
all the Colony nations.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:04.430
It's as though they've based war
on principles of sportsmanship.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.180
However,
one problem still remains.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:11.270
This competition takes place
on Earth.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.190
That's right.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.150
This filthy planet
on which we live.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.240
But this time around...

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.490
...there seems to be something
different about the tournament.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.620
Hey, you over there!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.250
Do you remember seeing this guy?

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.750
Well, now...

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.670
...how might this photo
affect today's fight?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:42.120
Neo China - Dragon Gundam

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.800
Today's fight is against
Neo China's Dragon Gundam.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:42.140
But you'll just have to wait
to see what kind of fighter pilots it.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.930
And now!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.930
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:54.480
Beat the Dragon Gundam

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.760
Beat the Dragon Gundam.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:58.440
Listen to me well, Sai Saici.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:02.410
You are to go to Earth
with the Dragon Gundam...

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:06.200
...and answer the question
of who will rule Space.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.160
You will show them that
Neo China is the one to rule.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:13.670
Bear that in mind,
and be sure to win.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.040
Understand?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.160
Space Colony Neo China

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.420
Then you must go!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:36.150
The Gundam is finally mine!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.480
Now rise, Kokuryu Gang, rise!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.650
Burn it all! Destroy!

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.900
And grab everything you can!

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.730
Look at that, Z uisen!

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:18.900
Do not despair, Keiun.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.730
Look at him.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:23.490
I never thought he would stoop
to becoming a common bandit.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.990
We no longer have any
choice in the matter.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.780
No, wait, Keiun!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:29.910
Do you see that?!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:44.720
Domon!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.760
Don't come any closer!

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:50.640
I'll use this on you!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.480
Let's get out of here!

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.150
Domon, who are these people?!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.570
I don't know!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:04.490
But look!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.910
These guys have a Gundam.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.290
Rain! Get the Shining Gundam!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.410
- I'm fighting!
- Okay!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.000
Wait just one moment!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.050
It is obvious to us that you are
a great Gundam Fighter!

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.760
We have a favor to ask of you!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:38.980
Okay, he'll be fine.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.270
But try to keep his arm still.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.650
Thank you so much.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.650
Oh, my. So many of them are hurt.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:50.070
Whatever medicine survived
the fire won't be enough.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.530
And besides, Domon's...

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.290
Please!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.290
Please!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:04.460
We ask that you destroy the
Gundam Fighter of Neo China!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.250
What?

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:08.630
I'm sure this must sound
incredibly strange to you.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:12.100
But this is our conclusion after
giving it a great deal of thought.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:15.140
Who are you guys, anyway?

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.390
Forgive us for not being clear.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.770
We are those who have remained
at the Shaolin Temple here on Earth.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.400
- The Shaolin Temple?
- That's right.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.730
Our Shaolin...

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.980
I know.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.440
That's right.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:30.910
The martial art school known
as the most powerful on Earth.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.780
But 60 years ago...

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:35.740
...most of the followers defected
to the Chikurin Temple on the Colony.

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:37.540
And now...

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.080
...the Temple is nothing more than
the keeper of the Shaolin name.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.500
Our master believed that...

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.880
...the Temple could be revived...

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.510
...if we could win a Gundam Fight
championship.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:52.680
So he sent his only son, Sai Saici,
to the Colony's Chikurin Temple...

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.260
...for intense training.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.720
Selected to pilot the
Dragon Gundam...

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.730
...he was sent back here to Earth.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.020
However...

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.730
...as you have witnessed...

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:05.860
...we've heard that he now
uses Mt. Godai as his base.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:09.860
So, before he causes further
embarrassment to the Temple...

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.280
...you want me to get rid of him?

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.780
Precisely!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.910
The best way would be to have him
lose in a Gundam Fight match.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.660
What if I refused?

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.170
- Impressive!
- In that case...!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.010
Will this change your mind?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.130
What is your answer?!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.930
Rain, I'll be waiting at Mt. Godai!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.520
Domon...

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:49.570
Do you believe that
he'll do as we ask?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:50.860
It's possible.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:54.450
Uh, could you put this away now?

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.200
Oh! W-we're terribly sorry!

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.720
Hey. What're you doing there?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:25.230
Hey! Would you mind
giving me a lift?

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.360
I can't.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.940
I'm in a hurry.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.190
I see.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.110
What's wrong?

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.990
I'm in a hurry, too.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.450
So, let's just get out of here.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:41.830
How did you...?

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:44.250
Come on! Let's go!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.880
Appreciate it.
You're a huge help!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.550
Yeah, right.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.880
Oh, well.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.760
You look like you've been
doing some traveling.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.510
Maybe you've come
across this man.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.270
Who is this guy?

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.460
If you don't know him,
then never mind.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:09.560
There's a village!

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.900
Hey, why don't we stay
there tonight?

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.740
Sorry, but some bandits got me.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.950
I'm broke.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:19.030
Don't worry. Just leave it to me.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.390
No hard feelings, right?

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.680
With the festival and all...

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.600
...they were looking for extra help.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.730
No one's going to let us
stay anywhere for free.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.560
Besides, I've been training
to become a chef.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.410
I am so tired!

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:05.700
Hey!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.540
What's this?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.460
Got it while I was cooking.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.800
You don't do anything for free,
do you?

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.010
Hey, guys!

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:26.680
They're having a festival!

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.390
Let's help ourselves
to the feast!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.520
It's them again.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.440
Dragon Gundam...

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.120
Duck!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.140
Damn!
They got the Core Lander!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.650
Gundam?!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:13.980
Hey, man!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.630
It looks like I'm going to
have to fight him anyway.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:40.590
Yeah. And to get back
my Core Lander.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:49.180
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.190
Hey, look.

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:57.860
That's the Great Wall,
from the old days.

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.030
They're using it as their base.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.690
It's well-guarded.

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:03.110
It won't be easy getting close.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.570
You seem to know a lot.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.080
You bet.
I've done my homewor...

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:11.160
Well...

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:14.960
I mean, the place I'm going to
is on the other side of it!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.960
I know!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.880
I'll go and check it out!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.760
It's my way of thanking you
for the ride!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.960
- Later!
- Hey! Wait!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.970
Who is that guy?

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:37.400
Hey! Hey! Do you wanna get
the credit for this?

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.480
Over there, over there!
Look carefully!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.660
Hey... Hey...

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.870
What? What took you...?

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.420
See, I told you!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.460
I found this guy snooping
all around your hideout!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.460
What're you trying to pull?!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.190
Just going with the flow!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.010
What are your intentions?!

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:11.010
What are you here for?!
Spit it out!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.310
Hey, give this guy some water!

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.230
How's that?
You feel like talking yet?

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.450
I've got nothing to say to you!

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:27.950
You'll pay!

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.280
That's enough!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.750
He's come to see me, right?

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.460
Y-yes, sir.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.710
Are you Sai Saici of
the Dragon Gundam?

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.720
You can't fight...

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.930
...without using all these thugs?

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:52.890
No wonder Keiun and Z uisen
were devastated.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.890
What's he talking about?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.390
How about settling our differences
with a Gundam Fight match?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.520
I see.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.690
So, you also have a Gundam.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.030
Well, then!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.980
We'll settle things right here!

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:15.370
Right!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.330
Stick him in a cell!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.750
H-hey...

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.040
Hey, kid!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.750
Are you with him?

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.050
N-not a chance!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.420
I'm just a simple, traveling chef.

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.800
I heard about how
powerful you are.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:31.680
And I thought maybe
I could become your chef.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.140
Fine. Whatever.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.810
Thank you!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.640
I won't ever have to
deal with you again!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.400
That kid's cooking ain't bad at all!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.580
Hey...

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:57.040
You've got to cut me some slack...

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.620
...I brought you some
food to make it up to you.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:03.380
You see, it was all part of my plan
to get into this place.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:07.590
To prove it to you,
I'm unlocking your cell door.

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:10.760
See? The rest is up to you.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:14.350
The Lander's inside the warehouse
by the main entrance.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.400
He's escaped!
The prisoner has escaped!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.900
Wh-what the...?!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.950
Domon's escaped from his cell!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.330
He's escaped, he's escaped,
he's escaped!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.410
Don't let him get to the Lander!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.060
What?!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.270
What are you doing here?!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:03.980
I wanted to thank you for taking
care of my precious thing!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.280
Article 4, Gundam Fight
International Regulations.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:22.160
"A Gundam Fighter must be
responsible for his Gundam!"

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:28.340
I'm going to find Sai Saici and...

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.710
Hey, man!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:40.850
So, there's Dragon Gundam!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.940
That's right!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:48.110
Thanks to you, I was able to
get my Gundam back!

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:49.730
Thanks!

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.440
You mean you're...?!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:53.320
Bingo!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.800
You got it! I am the real...

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.410
...Sai Saici!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:02.750
Then why would you...?!

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.460
Well, to tell you the truth...

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.960
...I had a bit of an accident when
I descended from the Colony.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.130
Before I realized it...

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:13.670
...the Gundam and I landed
in different places.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.510
Luckily, it was okay...

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.390
...but the bandits made
a toy out of it.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.220
So, that's why you used me.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:25.100
You can return the favor
with a match!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.100
Okay! Gundam Fight Standby!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.110
Ready...!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.690
...Go!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.460
Mobile Trace System checking
brainwaves, blood pressure...

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:03.600
...pulse, respiration, temperature,
metabolism. All green.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.710
All right!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.920
I'll show you the power
of my Dragon Gundam!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.760
You're not too bad.

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:47.520
I see why the Shaolin Temple
is counting on you...

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.520
...to revive their dream!

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.520
Just because I owe you...

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.230
...doesn't mean I'll go easy on you!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.870
Hey, that's no fair!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.020
Just flags?!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:28.730
Where is he?!

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:35.000
Hey, man.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:38.640
Can you see me?

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.150
My eyes are being tricked
by the flags.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.790
There you are!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.300
What the...?!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.890
I'm over here!

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:05.640
Above me?!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.850
Gotcha!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.180
The ultimate...

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:16.480
Shining Finger!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.580
This hand of mine glows
with an awesome power!

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.670
Its burning grip tells me
to defeat you!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.800
I'll finish you off, Sai Saici!

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:39.500
Stop right there!

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.110
I suggest you call
this match a draw!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.680
What?!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:49.550
Otherwise, you'll likely
end up losing your head!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:57.310
What now?

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.900
If you agree to a draw,
I'll pull back.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.740
You sure can be annoying.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:08.030
Fine, then.
I guess we'll call it a draw.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.210
Domon Kasshu.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:23.210
We deeply regret
causing you so much trouble.

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:27.340
The bandits have been handed
over to local authorities.

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:30.640
For this kind of thing
to never happen again...

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.270
...we shall watch over Sai Saici...

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:36.690
...and train him diligently
so that he'll be worthy...

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:39.190
...of carrying on
the Shaolin tradition.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.400
Please accept our apologies
for the trouble we caused.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:43.570
Farewell.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.910
It seems that the young boy
had nothing to do with him either.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:52.080
Yeah.

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:55.810
All that's left is
Neo France and Neo Russia.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.880
But I am going to find him,
no matter what.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:01.880
No matter what...

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.590
Let's go, Rain!

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:06.550
Right.

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.330
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:41.790
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:45.340
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:52.510
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:58.230
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.430 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:10.030
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:14.160
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:20.160
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:33.090
It's the moment you've
been waiting for!

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:37.430
Domon forces a match by
kidnapping the princess...

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:40.730
...who is in love with the
handsome George de Sand!

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:44.400
An infuriated George heads out
with his Gundam Rose!

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:45.860
With Paris as the backdrop...

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.150
...it's a collision between
European and Japanese chivalry!

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:52.160
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:55.560
Challenge! The Red Rose Knight.

00:23:54.570 --> 00:24:01.090
Challenge! The Red Rose Knight

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:58.700
Ready! Go!
